      "id": "42863f4c-43f9-4eb4-98ce-c63952ed3de6",
      "name": "EventType",
      "description": {
        "content": "An EventType is a registry entry representing a known event type. It\nserves as the canonical reference that both EventExposures and\nEventSubscriptions point to. EventTypes are identified by a dot-separated\nidentifier (e.g. \"de.telekom.eni.quickstart.v1\").\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
